{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Count retention captured by closures and bound built-ins.** A custom-renderable closure capturing a large buffer, or a bound built-in such as `large_list.append`, is skipped here even though `_copy_record_containers` retains it verbatim. A blocked lane can therefore admit far more than its 16 MB budget. Traverse retention-bearing fields such as function closures/defaults and bound `__self__` while excluding globals/code, or reject these opaque values; add closure and bound-method budget tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s7HRG","finding_digest":"ea6c1cf3405a9df9ac9ecf0e969171cbe08e51ef48754894a52ee1a6db3c26bc","finding_id":"arf_v1_5jwbz42alko7tle6z4hjnelrzp","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","line":86,"observation_digest":"19770b62040fadecf612fa800fad3e876bcdd87c5e73635ab78366fecd97bea1","observation_id":"aro_v1_df3qwyqeb6w6z5qs7kaa7lj6q5","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5jwbz42alko7tle6z4hjnelrzp","published_at":"2026-09-10T02:28:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bw5l62y7hiyctavp5cfur7ys7z","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"9a9cb0ef6bfa9e60f1f51f1a7adbb1afc61a38b6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":86,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_2m3ql4k7h6v53jhjejreuyaziq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T02:28:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
